        "created_at": "2014-08-19T19:04:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>In Baron Blade's 1st scenario, when he rolls 3 dice and needs a 5 or 6 to get a success, does any number of 5's and 6's count as a single success, or is each 5 and 6 a success? &nbsp;We read it that each 5 or 6 is a success, allowing BB to remove a scenario token with a single (good) roll. &nbsp;Is that correct?</p>",
